## 2. Subkode Karakter ke-5 (ICD-10 Extended / Tabulasi Detail)

Beberapa sistem rekam medis elektronik menggunakan ekstensi digit ke-5 untuk mempertegas jenis cedera superfisial:

* **T14.00** : *Superficial injury of unspecified body region, type unspecified*
* **T14.01** : *Superficial injury of unspecified body region: **Abrasion*** (Spesifik ekskoriasi / luka lecet)
* **T14.02** : *Superficial injury of unspecified body region: Blister* (Bula / vesikel / melepuh)
* **T14.03** : *Superficial injury of unspecified body region: Insect bite* (Gigitan serangga non-bisa)
* **T14.04** : *Superficial injury of unspecified body region: Superficial foreign body* (Benda asing superfisial / serpihan)
* **T14.05** : *Superficial injury of unspecified body region: Contusion* (Memar / hematoma superfisial)

